.195" end="01:04.570">it </span><span begin="01:04.570" end="01:04.860">makes </span><span begin="01:04.860" end="01:05.147">me </span><span begin="01:05.147" end="01:05.868">sad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.184" end="01:09.950"><span begin="01:06.184" end="01:06.351">It's </span><span begin="01:06.351" end="01:06.518">just </span><span begin="01:06.518" end="01:06.773">a </span><span begin="01:06.773" end="01:07.908">cigarette </span><span begin="01:07.908" end="01:08.099">like </span><span begin="01:08.099" end="01:08.370">you </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:09.057">always </span><span begin="01:09.057" end="01:09.312">used </span><span begin="01:09.312" end="01:09.616">to </span><span begin="01:09.616" end="01:09.950">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.024" end="01:14.813"><span begin="01:11.024" end="01:11.239">I </span><span begin="01:11.239" end="01:11.550">was </span><span begin="01:11.550" end="01:12.069">different </span><span begin="01:12.069" end="01:12.540">then </span><span begin="01:12.540" end="01:12.771">I </span><span begin="01:12.771" end="01:13.122">don't </span><span begin="01:13.122" end="01:13.385">need </span><span begin="01:13.385" end="01:13.736">them </span><span begin="01:13.736" end="01:14.031">to </span><span begin="01:14.031" end="01:14.286">be </span><span begin="01:14.286" end="01:14.813">cool</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.421" end="01:37.670"><span begin="01:33.421" end="01:33.652">It's </span><span begin="01:33.652" end="01:33.814">just </span><span begin="01:33.814" end="01:34.125">a </span><span begin="01:34.125" end="01:35.476">cigarette </span><span begin="01:35.476" end="01:35.659">and </span><span begin="01:35.659" end="01:36.018">it </span><span begin="01:36.018" end="01:36.393">harms </span><span begin="01:36.393" end="01:36.568">your </span><span begin="01:36.568" end="01:37.127">pretty </span><span begin="01:37.127" end="01:37.670">lungs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.992" e