2:10.144" end="02:10.515">just </span><span begin="02:10.515" end="02:10.738">a </span><span begin="02:10.738" end="02:11.825">cigarette </span><span begin="02:11.825" end="02:12.128">and </span><span begin="02:12.128" end="02:12.431">it's </span><span begin="02:12.431" end="02:12.654">just </span><span begin="02:12.654" end="02:12.973">a </span><span begin="02:12.973" end="02:13.645">Marlboro </span><span begin="02:13.645" end="02:14.021">light</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.623" end="02:18.741"><span begin="02:15.623" end="02:16.147">Maybe </span><span begin="02:16.147" end="02:16.378">but </span><span begin="02:16.378" end="02:16.737">is </span><span begin="02:16.737" end="02:16.952">it </span><span begin="02:16.952" end="02:17.205">worth </span><span begin="02:17.205" end="02:17.692">it </span><span begin="02:17.692" end="02:17.915">if </span><span begin="02:17.915" end="02:18.282">we </span><span begin="02:18.282" end="02:18.741">fight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.278" end="02:23.227"><span begin="02:19.278" end="02:19.477">It's </span><span begin="02:19.477" end="02:19.644">just </span><span begin="02:19.644" end="02:19.843">a </span><span begin="02:19.843" end="02:21.026">cigarette </span><span begin="02:21.026" end="02:21.229">that </span><span begin="02:21.229" end="02:21.564">I </span><span begin="02:21.564" end="02:21.819">got </span><span begin="02:21.819" end="02:22.242">from </span><span begin="02:22.242" end="02:22.841">Jamie </span><span begin="02:22.841" end="02:23.227">Lee</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.469" end="02:27.919"><span begin="02:23.469" end="02:23.740">Well </span><span begin="02:23.740" end="02:23.963">she's </span><span begin="02:23.963" end="02:24.562">gonna </span><span begin="02:24.562" end="02:24.793">get </span><span begin="02:24.793" end="02:25.104">a </span><span begin="02:25.104" end="02:25.655">smack </span><span begin="02:25.655" end="02:25.902">and </span><span begin="02:25.902" end="02:26.309